{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with a coach who helps you structure sustainable habits and measurable outcomes." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfb; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b6b6b; --accent:#4b8c6f; --accent-2:#3b6f57; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:12px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #f7faf6 0%, var(--bg) 100%);color:#0b0b0b;}
    header{backdrop-filter: blur(6px);position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.85),rgba(255,255,255,0.6));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,0.04);}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px;}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .brand .logo{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:#222;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(75,140,111,0.08)}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}

    /* Card */
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(20,20,20,0.05);padding:20px}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pattern accent */
    .pattern-hero{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.06;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:95% 10%;background-size:380px}

    /* Session planner */
    .planner h3{margin-top:0}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    .field{margin-bottom:12px}
    input[type="text"], input[type="number"], select, textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,0.08);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;font-size:15px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent-2);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .copy-success{color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600;margin-left:8px}

    /* Contact column */
    .contact-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    .contact-meta .phone{font-weight:600}

    /* Reveal animations */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1),transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;transform:none;opacity:1}
    }

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media (max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:16px}.brand .label{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="wrap">
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">W</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Approaches</a>
        <a href="services.html">Support Offerings</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="cta">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="pattern-hero" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h1>Let's frame a session that fits your real life</h1>
        <p class="lead">Use the planner to map 4 weeks of focused practice, with clear habits and measurable checkpoints. No jargon — just usable steps you can try this week.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>Quick contact</strong>
          <p class="muted">Prefer email or a call? Share a note and we’ll get back with next steps and availability.</p>
          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
            <div class="field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last" required></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" type="text" placeholder="you@domain.com" required></div>
            <div class="field"><label for="note">What would you like to work on?</label><textarea id="note" rows="3" placeholder="A few lines about goals or obstacles"></textarea></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" id="submitContact">Send message</button>
              <div class="muted">Or call <span class="phone">{{PHONE}}</span></div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="card planner reveal" data-reveal>
        <h3>Session Planner</h3>
        <p class="muted">Build a concise plan and copy a plaintext summary to paste into notes, email, or a calendar invite.</p>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="focus">Primary focus</label>
          <select id="focus">
            <option>Energy pacing</option>
            <option>Sleep rhythm</option>
            <option>Daily movement</option>
            <option>Nutrient consistency</option>
            <option>Mental clarity</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
          <div style="flex:1" class="field">
            <label for="length">Session length (mins)</label>
            <input id="length" type="number" min="15" max="120" value="45">
          </div>
          <div style="width:140px" class="field">
            <label for="frequency">Sessions / week</label>
            <input id="frequency" type="number" min="1" max="7" value="1">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="rating">Current habit rating (1=low — 5=steady)</label>
          <select id="rating">
            <option>1</option>
            <option>2</option>
            <option>3</option>
            <option selected>4</option>
            <option>5</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="approach">Preferred method</label>
          <select id="approach">
            <option>Ritual scaffolding</option>
            <option>Micro-shifts</option>
            <option>Check-ins & feedback</option>
            <option>Time-boxed practice</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
          <button class="btn" id="buildPlan">Create plan</button>
          <button class="btn" id="copyPlan" style="background:var(--accent);">Copy summary</button>
          <span id="copyMsg" class="copy-success" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">Copied</span>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <label for="summary">Plan summary</label>
          <textarea id="summary" rows="8" readonly placeholder="Your plan will appear here"></textarea>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2>Contact details</h2>
      <p class="muted">Prefer a direct note? Reach out and we’ll recommend a starting session type and next steps.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div class="card" style="padding:12px;min-width:220px">
          <div class="muted">Phone</div>
          <div class="phone">{{PHONE}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:12px;min-width:220px">
          <div class="muted">Email</div>
          <div>{{EMAIL}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:12px;min-width:220px">
          <div class="muted">Office</div>
          <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <p class="muted">Sessions prioritize outcomes, micro-habits, and simple frameworks you can keep returning to. These are coaching tools, not medical advice.</p>
      <ul style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">
        <li>Weekly checkpoints with one measurable practice</li>
        <li>Adjustments based on lived schedule and energy</li>
        <li>Tools for habit recovery and consistency</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · <span class="muted">Need help? Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></span></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Fill year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Scroll-triggered reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var revealed = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){
        revealed.forEach(function(el){ el.classList.add('is-visible'); });
        return;
      }
      if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
          entries.forEach(function(entry){
            if(entry.isIntersecting){
              entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
              obs.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          });
        }, {threshold:0.12});
        revealed.forEach(function(el){ obs.observe(el); });
      } else {
        // fallback
        revealed.forEach(function(el){ el.classList.add('is-visible'); });
      }
    })();

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      var elBuild = document.getElementById('buildPlan');
      var elCopy = document.getElementById('copyPlan');
      var elSummary = document.getElementById('summary');
      var elCopyMsg = document.getElementById('copyMsg');

      function makePlan(){
        var focus = document.getElementById('focus').value;
        var length = document.getElementById('length').value;
        var freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
        var rating = document.getElementById('rating').value;
        var approach = document.getElementById('approach').value;

        var baseline = {
          '1': 'Establish a tiny, repeatable first step that succeeds daily.',
          '2': 'Build short habits with gentle increases; prioritise consistency.',
          '3': 'Add one measurable checkpoint each week to track impact.',
          '4': 'Refine pacing and add recovery nodes to reduce friction.',
          '5': 'Scale practice selectively; emphasize sustainment and review.'
        };

        var planLines = [];
        planLines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Session plan');
        planLines.push('Focus: ' + focus);
        planLines.push('Session length: ' + length + ' min · Frequency: ' + freq + 'x/week');
        planLines.push('Method: ' + approach);
        planLines.push('Starting habit rating: ' + rating + '/5');
        planLines.push('');
        planLines.push('Week-by-week outline:');

        // Create four-week structure
        for(var i=1;i<=4;i++){
          var weekNote = '';
          if(i===1) weekNote = 'Week 1 — Start small: ' + baseline[rating] + ' Focus on one anchor.';
          else if(i===2) weekNote = 'Week 2 — Embed: Add a short cue and pair with an existing routine.';
          else if(i===3) weekNote = 'Week 3 — Check progress: Note barriers and simplify practice.';
          else weekNote = 'Week 4 — Consolidate: Keep what works, set a sustainable cadence.';
          planLines.push('  ' + i + '. ' + weekNote);
        }

        planLines.push('');
        planLines.push('Suggested micro-habits:');
        if(focus.toLowerCase().includes('energy') || focus.toLowerCase().includes('sleep')){
          planLines.push('- Morning 3-minute check-in; adjust caffeine and movement timing.');
          planLines.push('- Evening wind-down: 15 minutes of low-stimulus activity.');
        } else if(focus.toLowerCase().includes('movement')){
          planLines.push('- 10-minute daily movement window immediately after waking.');
          planLines.push('- Two mobility mini-breaks during longer work periods.');
        } else if(focus.toLowerCase().includes('nutrient')){
          planLines.push('- Plate-based consistency: add a protein or veg at each main meal.');
          planLines.push('- Carry a simple snack to avoid long energy dips.');
        } else {
          planLines.push('- One short mental reset: 3 deep breaths, 2-minute reflection.');
          planLines.push('- A check-in prompt twice weekly to note wins and barriers.');
        }

        planLines.push('');
        planLines.push('Next steps: Schedule a 45-minute intake to personalise targets. ' + (window.location.hostname ? 'Use the booking page.' : '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}'));

        return planLines.join('\n');
      }

      elBuild.addEventListener('click', function(){
        elSummary.value = makePlan();
        elCopyMsg.style.display = 'none';
      });

      elCopy.addEventListener('click', async function(){
        if(!elSummary.value){
          elSummary.value = makePlan();
        }
        try{
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(elSummary.value);
          elCopyMsg.style.display = 'inline-block';
          setTimeout(function(){ elCopyMsg.style.display = 'none'; }, 2200);
        }catch(e){
          // fallback: select and execCopy
          elSummary.select();
          try{ document.execCommand('copy'); elCopyMsg.style.display = 'inline-block'; setTimeout(function(){ elCopyMsg.style.display = 'none'; },2200);}catch(e2){ alert('Copy failed — select the text and copy manually.'); }
        }
      });

      // Basic contact form handler (local demo)
      document.getElementById('submitContact').addEventListener('click', function(){
        var name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
        var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
        var note = document.getElementById('note').value.trim();
        if(!name || !email){
          alert('Please include name and email.'); return;
        }
        // Simulate sending
        this.textContent = 'Sending...';
        this.disabled = true;
        setTimeout(function(){
          alert('Thanks — we received your message. We will follow up at ' + email);
          document.getElementById('submitContact').textContent = 'Send message';
          document.getElementById('submitContact').disabled = false;
          document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
        },900);
      });

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk provides the contact page and notes for the wellness coach site (layoutFamily: aura_editorial, voice: clinical_calm).

Files included:
- contact.html — The contact page with an integrated "Session Planner" interactive widget and a scroll-triggered section reveal system.
- README.md — This document.

Placeholders to replace in contact.html:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}} (not used on this page but present across the project)
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Key features implemented locally (no external libs):
- Scroll-triggered reveal: elements with the data-reveal attribute animate into view. Respects prefers-reduced-motion by revealing immediately.
- Session Planner widget: build a four-week plaintext plan based on user inputs (focus, session length, frequency, current rating, approach). The plan appears in a readonly textarea and can be copied to clipboard via the Copy summary button. Uses navigator.clipboard with a fallback to document.execCommand.
- A minimal contact form UI (demo behavior only; no server integration).

Notes & usage:
- The page references assets/img/pattern.svg for decorative background. Ensure that asset exists in the project.
- No external fonts or CDNs are used. All styling is inline in contact.html.
- Content deliberately avoids medical claims; it focuses on habits, frameworks, and outcomes.

Accessibility:
- Reduced-motion preference is respected.
- Buttons and form fields are keyboard-accessible.

Customization:
- Update placeholder tokens with real business values.
- Integrate the contact form with your backend in the form handler section in contact.html.

